```plaintext
Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```

```turtle
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/autonomous-driving#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

ex:Scene1 a ex:DrivingScene ;
    ex:hasWeatherCondition ex:HeavyRain ;
    ex:hasVisibilityLevel "Low" ;
    ex:hasTime "Daytime" .

ex:HeavyRain a ex:WeatherCondition ;
    ex:hasIntensity "High" ;
    ex:reducesVisibility .

ex:Road ex:hasLaneMarkings ;
    ex:hasLaneType "DoubleSolidWhite" ;
    ex:hasSurfaceCondition "Wet" .

ex:Vehicle1 a ex:AutonomousVehicle ;
    ex:hasPosition ex:FrontOfScene ;
    ex:hasSpeed "Slow" ;
    ex:hasEnvironmentalCondition ex:Rainy .

ex:BusStop a ex:RoadInfrastructure ;
    ex:hasLocation ex:RightSideOfRoad ;
    ex:hasCoveredArea ;
    ex:hasShelter .

ex:StreetLight1 a ex:RoadInfrastructure ;
    ex:hasLocation ex:LeftSideOfRoad ;
    ex:hasCondition "Active" .

ex:TrafficSign1 a ex:RoadInfrastructure ;
    ex:hasLocation ex:CenterBackground ;
    ex:hasType "StopOrYield" ;
    ex:isOccluded "Yes" .

ex:PedestrianArea a ex:RoadInfrastructure ;
    ex:hasLocation ex:RightSideOfRoad ;
    ex:hasCondition "PartiallyVisible" .

ex:PalmTrees a ex:Obstacle ;
    ex:hasLocation ex:RightSideOfRoad ;
    ex:hasCondition "PartiallyOccluding" .

ex:Vehicle1 ex:isApproaching ex:BusStop .
ex:Vehicle1 ex:hasEnvironmentalInteraction ex:HeavyRain .
ex:TrafficSign1 ex:isOccludedBy ex:PalmTrees .
ex:PalmTrees ex:partiallyOccludes ex:PedestrianArea .
```

---

**Identified Risks for each risk class**

**Risk 1:**
Description: Reduced visibility due to heavy rain significantly impairs the autonomous vehicle's ability to detect and interpret road signs, pedestrians, and other vehicles.
Severity Score: 0.9

**Risk 2:**
Description: Occlusion of traffic signs by palm trees and heavy rain reduces the autonomous vehicle's ability to read and respond to traffic instructions.
Severity Score: 0.8

**Risk 3:**
Description: Wet road conditions increase the risk of hydroplaning, reducing vehicle control and stability.
Severity Score: 0.7

**Risk 4:**
Description: Partially visible pedestrian area on the right side of the road may indicate pedestrians or cyclists entering the roadway, posing a collision risk.
Severity Score: 0.85

**Risk 5:**
Description: The autonomous vehicle's sensors may struggle to accurately detect and classify objects in low-visibility conditions, leading to potential misidentification of obstacles.
Severity Score: 0.8

